mcaster1dawcast (1.0.0~alpha-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Multi-track audio recording and editing.
  * Video editing with FFmpeg backend.
  * Live broadcasting to Icecast/DNAS/RTMP.
  * Podcast production with chapters, RSS, loudness metering.
  * Broadcast graphics: lower thirds, ticker, overlays, watermarks.
  * 10 audio DSP effects, 10 video transitions.
  * Theme engine with 3 included themes.

